fftSize 1024 → ~47 Hz per bin at 48 kHz: bins 1-6 (47-330 Hz) are the kick and the bass line;
"loudness" is the mean of the first 128 bins (0-6 kHz), where the music actually lives —
averaging the whole 0-24 kHz range would let the empty top half drag every song to "quiet".

