THE MANAGER'S BULLY CLUB STUNS THE PLAYER (2026-09-28): his baton is the Bully Club, and a landed hit from it freezes the player
for one turn (one monster swing, _monAtkIntervalSec), the same length the club stuns a monster for. A stunned player cannot walk,
swing or fire until it wears off (window._playerStunned, read by _movePlayerSubstepped and _fireHeld). Off: window._managerClubStun = false.

RANGED player animations (Mark 2026-06-21): PISTOL/MAGIC MISSILE → pistol-shoot one-shot;
bow / crossbow / thrown → bow-fire one-shot (was the generic melee wind-up). Both default to the
attack clip until Mark designates the real NlaTrack numbers (window._avatarClips.bow / .pistol).

ACTION-CAM FACE (2026-10-16, CODER 1, Mark: "when player attacks - you nicely softly quickly face the point for the action
   cam"): a player-attack face (force, not a glance) is a timed ease-IN-OUT instead of the exponential ease-out that started at
   full speed (the jerk) and crawled the last degrees. Duration 0.18 s + 0.12 s per radian, cap 0.45 s; tracks a moving target;
   your own turn still cancels it above. Knobs: _attackFaceBaseMs (180), _attackFacePerRadMs (120), _attackFaceMaxMs (450);
   off (old ease-out): window._attackFaceEase = false.

